{"id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-formula.md","title":"First-order formula (legacy finite syntax)","display":"df-formula — First-order formula (legacy finite syntax)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-formula","aliases":["27-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — First-order formula (legacy finite syntax)","depends_on":["[[27-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — First-order formula (legacy finite syntax)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 及有限树约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23484c14c788f5da\" href=\"?note=23484c14c788f5da\" title=\"27-df-atomic-formula\">27-df-atomic-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 是候选公式树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"5,6,7,8,9,10\">\\(5,6,7,8,9,10\\)</span> 与项/原子式标签互异；下式固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists\\)</span> 为对象语法构造子。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle9,x,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle10,x,\\varphi\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle9,x,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle10,x,\\varphi\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{S,0}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{S,0}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{S,d+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{S,d}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{S,d+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{S,d}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>保留旧 27 语法的三个二元联结词，不将另一册含原始双条件的公式载体直接冒充本载体。自然数阶段并集给出一个集合及最小闭包，替代原先对未限制候选类的取交。</li>\n<li>构造子标签互异且元组单射，故项、原子式、否定、二元式、量词式有唯一外层分解；后续结构递归由此良定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"23484c14c788f5da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 及有限树约定见 [[27-df-atomic-formula]]；$d\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\varphi,\\psi$ 是候选公式树，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"5,6,7,8,9,10","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle6,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle7,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle8,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle9,x,\\varphi\\rangle,\\qquad\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle10,x,\\varphi\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{S,0}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{S,d+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d}\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\}\\cup\\{Qx\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\mathrm{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_{S,d},\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{S,d}.","display":true}],"bytes":2122,"backlinks":[{"id":"1989ed1d02ace2f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$。"},{"id":"81e99b41571ec995","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；赋值与满足见 [[27-df-assignment]]、[[27-df-satisfaction]]。引入同签名子结构关系 $\\subseteq_S$、初等子结构关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A$ 在本原子仅为 $\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A$ 的局部别名。"},{"id":"1b2b007156524813","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{ct}$ 见 [[27-df-formula]] 及其内建项上游。"},{"id":"ca9848cce4cd0fc2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 来自 [[27-df-formula]] 及其项上游；引入 $\\mathrm{Syn}_S,\\mathrm{GNum}_S$。"},{"id":"2c598a7d73fbab7e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]、[[27-df-sentence]]；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。"},{"id":"404af7df141b9e06","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"使用 [[27-df-formula]] 的有限树语法；$\\mathbf0,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m$ 是四个互异形式符号。$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 在下式记录一个常量、一个一元函数、两个二元函数、无关系的算术签名，不是标准自然数结构。"},{"id":"ae3aea7249664c55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$。"},{"id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；项解释见 [[27-df-term-interpretation]]，语法见 [[27-df-formula]]。关系符号及其项列在关系原子分支中局部限定；允许无关系符号的签名。"},{"id":"3b0b19b94b9984da","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]，$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[27-df-free-variable]]。引入 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。"},{"id":"0340b31d187863dd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[27-df-formula]]；$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。上下文保持集合表示，允许无限集合；引入 $\\mathrm{Sequent}_S$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-formula|df-formula — First-order formula (legacy finite syntax)]]"}],"outgoing":["23484c14c788f5da"]}